WEBVTT

00:00:17.453 --> 00:00:18.704
(Susan yells)

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.427
Crush them all.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.534
(all yelling, grunting)

00:01:16.387 --> 00:01:18.139
- (growls)
- (horse whinnies)

00:01:18.222 --> 00:01:20.808
(growling)

00:01:21.392 --> 00:01:22.810
(grunts)

00:01:28.023 --> 00:01:29.316
Ah!

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:45.374
Aslan!

00:01:48.711 --> 00:01:51.380
- (both laughing)
- Oh!

00:01:54.884 --> 00:01:58.220
I knew it was you.
The whole time, I knew it.

00:01:58.304 --> 00:02:00.514
But the others didn't believe me.

00:02:00.598 --> 00:02:03.058
And why would that stop you
from coming to me?

00:02:05.895 --> 00:02:08.773
I'm sorry. I was too
scared to come alone.

00:02:10.691 --> 00:02:12.735
Why wouldn't you show yourself?

00:02:12.818 --> 00:02:16.030
Why couldn't you come roaring in
and save us like last time?

00:02:16.113 --> 00:02:19.742
Things never happen
the same way twice, dear one.

00:02:24.747 --> 00:02:29.877
If I'd have come earlier, would everyone
who died... could I have stopped that?

00:02:31.921 --> 00:02:34.965
We can never know
what would have happened, Lucy.

00:02:35.049 --> 00:02:39.345
But what will happen
is another matter entirely.

00:02:39.428 --> 00:02:41.847
- You mean you'll help?
- Of course.

00:02:41.931 --> 00:02:45.559
- As will you.
- Oh, I wish I was braver.

00:02:45.643 --> 00:02:48.521
If you were any braver,
you'd be a lioness.

00:02:48.604 --> 00:02:53.567
Now, I think your friends have slept
long enough, don't you?

00:02:53.651 --> 00:02:56.737
(roaring)

00:03:25.599 --> 00:03:27.685
Come on!

00:04:08.851 --> 00:04:12.146
(rumbling)

00:04:31.457 --> 00:04:34.376
- Lucy.
- (cheering)

00:04:56.398 --> 00:04:59.026
(cheering)

00:04:59.109 --> 00:05:02.321
- For Aslan!
- (all yelling)

00:05:06.909 --> 00:05:09.745
We can defeat them
if we draw them to the river.

00:05:09.828 --> 00:05:12.831
We must regroup.
To Beruna!

00:05:12.915 --> 00:05:16.710
- To the bridge!
- (sounding horn)

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.518
Charge!

00:06:14.601 --> 00:06:17.146
(all yelling)

00:06:24.486 --> 00:06:27.531
(roaring)

00:06:42.671 --> 00:06:45.591
(man) What is happening?

00:06:47.301 --> 00:06:48.594
- The river!
- Retreat!

00:06:48.677 --> 00:06:50.679
Back! Back!

